            "actually_needed": "The PyPI wheel contains only the `cortex_ai_memory` Python module (native .so), no `cortex-mcp-server` binary; the CLI in the README examples comes from the GitHub Releases tarball `cortex-mcp-server-linux-x86_64.tar.gz` (installed to ~/.local/bin).",
            "kind": "note"
          },
